<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Dec 31.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Dec 31.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the Russian Far East on Sakhalin island, the Kamchatka peninsula, Magadan and Khabarovsk regions may be closed on December 31 due to strong winds, low clouds and snow storms, the Russian Weather Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
